    "Reason : 1 - Under Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the General Permitted Development Order 2015 (as amended), prior approval would be required and REFUSED for the following reason:\r\n\r\nIn the absence of accurate dimensions confirming and maximum height of the enlarged part of the dwellinghouse, the developer has provided insufficient information to enable the authority to establish whether the proposal would accord with criteria A.4(2)(a)(ii), of Class A, Part 1, Schedule 2, of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development Order) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).\r\n\r\n",
    "Reason : 2 - Under Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the General Permitted Development Order 2015 (as amended), prior approval would be required and REFUSED for the following reason:\r\n\r\nDue to the proposed development having an eaves height of 3.33m exceeding 3m, the proposal would not accord with criteria A.1(i) of Class A, Part 1, Schedule 2, of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development Order) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).\r\n",
    "Reason : 3 - Under Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the General Permitted Development Order 2015 (as amended), prior approval would be required and REFUSED for the following reason:\r\n\r\nIn the absence of details of proposed external facing materials, the scheme would fail to comply with condition A.3(a) of Class A, Part 1, Schedule 2, of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development Order) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).\r\n"
